:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-01.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-[var(--red)] text-[var(--paper)] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold px-3 py-1 tracking-widest\">Commission Guide</div></div><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\"><span>January 15, 2025</span><span>•</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"font-anton text-2xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] group-hover:text-[var(--yellow)] transition-colors leading-tight\"><a href=\"/blog/how-to-commission-custom-album-cover-art\">How to Commission a Custom Album Cover: The Complete 2026 Guide</a></h2><p class=\"text-[var(--paper-2)]/80 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">Your music is finished, mix is tight, and mastering is done. Here is how to commission custom cover art, manga illustrations, or book artwork online without the back-and-forth confusion.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--yellow)] uppercase tracking-wider hover:underline inli