rcase text-[var(--paper)] group-hover:text-[var(--yellow)] transition-colors leading-tight\"><a href=\"/blog/how-to-commission-custom-illustration-online\">How to Commission Custom Illustration Art Online</a></h2><p class=\"text-[var(--paper-2)]/80 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">Not every commission starts with an album or a manga chapter. Custom illustration is one of the most flexible things you can commission, and also one of the easiest to get wrong if you go in without a plan.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--yellow)] uppercase tracking-wider hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/blog/how-to-commission-custom-illustration-online\">Read Full Guide →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 hover:border-[var(--yellow)] transition-all flex flex-col group overflow-hidden shadow-lg\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[var(--paper-2)]\"><img alt=\"AI-Generated Art vs. Hiring a Human Illustrator: What Actually Makes Sense for Your Cover\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fcover-03.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-[var(--red)] text-[var(--paper)] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold px-3 py-1 tracking-widest\">Industry Insights</div></div><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\"><span>March 5, 2025</span><span>•</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"font-anton text-2xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] group-hover:text-[var(--yellow)] transition-colors leading-tight\"><a href=\"/blog/ai-art-vs-human-illustrator-cover-art\">AI-Generated Art vs. Hiring a Human Illustrator: What Actually Makes Sense for Your Cover</a></h2><p class=\"text-[var(--paper-2)]/80 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">Type a prompt, wait thirty seconds, get a cover. It&#x27;s fast and cheap. But here&#x27;s an honest breakdown of when AI-generated covers work, when they don&#x27;t, and why artists still hire human illustrators.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--yellow)] uppercase tracking-wider hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/blog/ai-art-vs-human-illustrator-cover-art\">Read Full Guide →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 hover:border-[var(--yellow)] transition-all flex flex-col group overflow-hidden shadow-lg\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[var(--paper-2)]\"><img alt=\"How Much Does Custom Album Cover Art Actually Cost in 2026?\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300