l-cover-art-do-you-need-both\">Concept Art vs Final Cover Art: Do You Need Both?</a></h2><p class=\"text-[var(--paper-2)]/80 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">Concept art and a final cover aren&#x27;t the same commission with different polish levels — they&#x27;re solving genuinely different problems. Here&#x27;s how to tell which one you need.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--yellow)] uppercase tracking-wider hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/blog/concept-art-vs-final-cover-art-do-you-need-both\">Read Full Guide →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 hover:border-[var(--yellow)] transition-all flex flex-col group overflow-hidden shadow-lg\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[var(--paper-2)]\"><img alt=\"5 Album Covers That Actually Worked (And Why)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcover-art%2Fkhaidnww.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-[var(--red)] text-[var(--paper)] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold px-3 py-1 tracking-widest\">Design Breakdown</div></div><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\"><span>December 5, 2025</span><span>•</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2 class=\"font-anton text-2xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] group-hover:text-[var(--yellow)] transition-colors leading-tight\"><a href=\"/blog/album-covers-that-actually-work-examples\">5 Album Covers That Actually Worked (And Why)</a></h2><p class=\"text-[var(--paper-2)]/80 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">It&#x27;s easy to say a cover &#x27;just works&#x27; without saying why. Here&#x27;s an actual breakdown of the specific design decisions that separate a strong cover from a forgettable one.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--yellow)] uppercase tracking-wider hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/blog/album-covers-that-actually-work-examples\">Read Full Guide →</a></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"order\" class=\"ticket-build-section py-[72px] bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[800px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"section-head mb-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"eyebrow font-mono text-xs text-[var(--yellow)] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase mb-[18px] inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] before:w-5 before:h-[2px] before:bg-[var(--yellow)] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:w-5 after:h-[2px] after:bg-[var(--yellow)]\">Commission Order Form</div><h2 class=\"text-[clamp(36px,6vw,56px)] font-anton uppercase text-[var(--paper)]\">Create Job Ticket</h2></div><div class=\"ticket relative bg-[var(--ink)] color-[var(--paper)] border-2 border-[var(--paper)] p-6 md:p-12 shadow-[12px_12px_0_var(--red)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"notch tl\"></div><div class=\"notch tr\"></div><div class=\"notch bl\"></div><div class=\"notch br\"></div><div class=\"ticket-header flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)] pb-4 mb-8\"><div class=\"font-anton text-2xl tracking-wider text-[var(--yellow)]\">JHAY SANYAY STUDIO</div><div class=\"font-mono text-xs md:text-sm text-[var(--paper-2)] tracking-widest uppercase\">TICKET NO: <span class=\"font-bold text-[var(--red)]\"></span></div></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Client / Stage Name <span class=\"text-[var(--red)]\">*</span></label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Starboy / Divine\" class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Email or Social Handle <span class=\"text-[var(--red)]\">*</span></label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. @artist / email@domain.com\" class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Service Category</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><option value=\"Single Cover Art\" selected=\"\">Single Cover Art</option><option value=\"EP / Album Art\">EP / Album Art</option><option value=\"Logo / Brand Mark\">Logo / Brand Mark</option><option value=\"Comic Page\">Comic Page</option><option value=\"Motion / Animated Cover\">Motion / Animated Cover</option></select></div><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Project / Release Title</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Midnight Riddim EP\" class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Target Release / Deadline</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Oct 15th / ASAP\" class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Preferred Contact Method</label><select class=\"w-full bg-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] p-3 text-[var(--paper)] font-sans focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--yellow)] focus:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><option value=\"Email\" selected=\"\">Email</option><option value=\"Instagram DM\">Instagram DM</option><option value=\"WhatsApp\">WhatsApp</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--paper-2)] mb-2\">Project Brief &amp; Visual Notes <span class=\"text-[var(--red)]\">*</span></label><textarea required=\"\" rows=\"4\" place